{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_289A5B1B","title":"Well I Talked to Him","entry":"Dlg_289A5B1B::entry","exit":"Dlg_289A5B1B::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_F938C5D1","articyId":"72057778721525211","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Roxi Fynx","text":"You're back. Did you get the jersey? More importantly, did you rip that fucker's skin off and make him wear it as a coat?","speakerId":"Ntt_149A06A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You're back. Did you get the jersey? More importantly, did you rip that fucker's skin off and make him wear it as a coat?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":400.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32942","byteOffset":20347360,"byteLength":504}},{"id":"DFr_95CF8E6B","articyId":"72057778721525255","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Roxi Fynx","text":"And let a poorly integrated post-doc mental health intern who couldn't make it as a neurotech tell me to get in touch with my feelings and engage in self care? ","speakerId":"Ntt_149A06A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And let a poorly integrated post-doc mental health intern who couldn't make it as a neurotech tell me to get in touch with my feelings and engage in self care? ","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1000.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39386","byteOffset":29230600,"byteLength":512}},{"id":"DFr_D531E55F","articyId":"72057778721525276","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Roxi Fynx","text":"Yeah, I'll get right on it. Now come on, the jersey!? I got someone lined up to buy it before tonight's match. We're doing a midnight galactic showdown.","speakerId":"Ntt_149A06A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah, I'll get right on it. Now come on, the jersey!? I got someone lined up to buy it before tonight's match. We're doing a midnight galactic showdown.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1600.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51707","byteOffset":33976656,"byteLength":496}},{"id":"DFr_D0EE2142","articyId":"72057778721525304","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Roxi Fynx","text":"FUCK! Well, that's just great. He's probably selling the threads for 500 Lims or something like that. That money should be mine.","speakerId":"Ntt_149A06A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"FUCK! Well, that's just great. He's probably selling the threads for 500 Lims or something like that. That money should be mine.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":2200.0,"y":625.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47813","byteOffset":32423488,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_17502A0E","articyId":"72057778721525326","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Roxi Fynx","text":"I don't have time before tonight's match. I got a press circuit and a few autographs to sign for those that managed to get a curfew pass.","speakerId":"Ntt_149A06A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I don't have time before tonight's match. I got a press circuit and a few autographs to sign for those that managed to get a curfew pass.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2800.0,"y":875.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26767","byteOffset":18005472,"byteLength":448}},{"id":"DFr_48532260","articyId":"72057778721525333","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Roxi Fynx","text":"A thousand! Are you kidding me?! That son-of-a-bitch!","speakerId":"Ntt_149A06A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"A thousand! Are you kidding me?! That son-of-a-bitch!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":2800.0,"y":625.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20352","byteOffset":15583576,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_5153337C","articyId":"72057778721525348","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Roxi Fynx","text":"Yeah, cool. Cool is what pays the bills.","speakerId":"Ntt_149A06A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah, cool. Cool is what pays the bills.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3400.0,"y":625.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17046","byteOffset":14338944,"byteLength":348}},{"id":"DFr_9087DDBC","articyId":"72057778721525362","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Roxi Fynx","text":"That's exactly what I'm going to do. If you're friends with an oral surgeon, maybe give 'em a heads up they'll be some new patients come tomorrow.","speakerId":"Ntt_149A06A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That's exactly what I'm going to do. If you're friends with an oral surgeon, maybe give 'em a heads up they'll be some new patients come tomorrow.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":4000.0,"y":625.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49759","byteOffset":33167456,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_2B5C3B2B","articyId":"72057778721525376","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Roxi Fynx","text":"I... Wow. I am honestly speechless. I really can't believe you got it from him.","speakerId":"Ntt_149A06A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I... Wow. I am honestly speechless. I really can't believe you got it from him.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":2500.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28520","byteOffset":18673008,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_29E4EEEA","articyId":"72057778721525397","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Roxi Fynx","text":"It's a nice gesture, that's all I'm sayin'. Gonna use it to fuel my next match. I'ma win it for you. For this. Thank you.","speakerId":"Ntt_149A06A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's a nice gesture, that's all I'm sayin'. Gonna use it to fuel my next match. I'ma win it for you. For this. Thank you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3100.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29047","byteOffset":18870656,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_1B76022D","articyId":"72057778721525405","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Roxi Fynx","text":"He was selling this for a thousand Lims! Jools and Drools that's insane!","speakerId":"Ntt_149A06A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He was selling this for a thousand Lims! Jools and Drools that's insane!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":3100.0,"y":125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25725","byteOffset":17616136,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_971465E1","articyId":"72057778721525419","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Roxi Fynx","text":"I'm not gonna forget this. I'm gonna use it to fuel my next match. I'ma win it for you. For this. Thank you","speakerId":"Ntt_149A06A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm not gonna forget this. I'm gonna use it to fuel my next match. I'ma win it for you. For this. Thank you","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":3674.0,"y":125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19122","byteOffset":15119816,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_1019DF38","articyId":"72057778721525247","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You really should talk to a TheraPay Bot.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You really should talk to a TheraPay Bot.","TextSheVersion":"You really should talk to a TheraPay Bot.","TextTheyVersion":"You really should talk to a TheraPay Bot."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":700.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29757","byteOffset":19138736,"byteLength":324}},{"id":"DFr_2B444E51","articyId":"72057778721525262","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"... well, yeah.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"... well, yeah.","TextSheVersion":"... well, yeah.","TextTheyVersion":"... well, yeah."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1300.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43971","byteOffset":30969576,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_62368ECD","articyId":"72057778721525268","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"That actually does sound dumb.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That actually does sound dumb.","TextSheVersion":"That actually does sound dumb.","TextTheyVersion":"That actually does sound dumb."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1300.0,"y